        <td id="descriptionArea">
            Test url: <a href="http://192.168.250.48/amms-web/">http://192.168.250.48/amms-web/</a><br/>
Bug#01: Problems found in Journal Page after Pay salary for designation &quot;Medical Officer (Health Complex)&quot;<br/>
Screenshot: Please see details in screenshot<br/>
<a href="http://192.168.0.3:8080/secure/attachment/34429/FH%2308.JPG">http://192.168.0.3:8080/secure/attachment/34429/FH%2308.JPG</a><br/>
<br/>
Expected: Should correct the mentioned problems in screenshot as per HRM journal mapping excel file<br/>
<br/>
Got the same problem for following Designations-<br/>
1. Medical Officer (Health Complex)	<br/>
2. Physiotherapist (Health Complex)	<br/>
3. Medical Technologist (Health Complex)<br/>
4. Counselor (Health Complex)	<br/>
5. Paramedic/Satellite paramedic (Health Complex)<br/>
6. Receptionist/Computer operator (Health Complex)	<br/>
7. Health Assistant (Health Complex)<br/>
8. Peon/Aya (Health Complex)<br/>
<br/>
Note: Service Benefit journal is auto created for above designations.<br/>
Service Benefit journal will not be created for &quot;Social Program&quot; Employee type
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

